<title>UK: Waterschapsbank sets 250 million DFL January 2009 bond. [CORRECTED 11:46 GMT]</title>
<headline>Waterschapsbank sets 250 million DFL January 2009 bond. [CORRECTED 11:46 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p>(Corrects headline to read &quot;January 2009 bond&quot; not &quot;13-year bond&quot;)  BORROWER   NEDERLANDSE WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    15.JAN.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.53    PAY DATE  L-15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.88     SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     SALE LIMS  US/UK     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    35 BP     SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED SEPT 2007 AND APRIL 2010 DSL</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
